---
layout: base.njk
title: "Pricing — Nirmaan"
description: "Starting prices for websites, online stores, web apps and platforms, optional care plans and a free estimator. Fixed quotes, milestone payments."
ogDescription: "Starting prices, fixed quotes and milestone payments. See what a website, web app or full platform costs with Nirmaan."
permalink: "/pricing.html"
scripts: ["estimator.js"]
nav: "pricing"
head:
  eyebrow: "Pricing"
  lines: ["Honest prices,", "fixed before we start."]
  accent: 1
  lede: "Starting prices for the kinds of systems we build, one fixed quote for yours, and payments that follow progress. No hourly meter, no surprise invoices."
  glyph: "00100/01110/00100/01110/00100"
  actions:
    - { label: "Compare plans", href: "#plans", style: "primary" }
    - { label: "Estimate a budget", href: "#estimator" }
cta:
  eyebrow: "Not sure which one fits?"
  lines: ["Describe the problem.", "We'll price the fix."]
  text: "Most people don't know whether they need a website, an app or an automation. You don't have to. Tell us what's going wrong and you'll get a fixed quote for the simplest system that solves it."
  primary: { label: "Tell us your problem", href: "/contact.html" }
  secondary: { label: "How we work", href: "/process.html" }
---
<section class="section" id="plans" aria-labelledby="build-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Build</p>
        <h2 class="section__title display" id="build-title">One-time price for the&nbsp;system.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section__text">Starting prices for the simplest version of each kind of project. Your fixed quote comes after a free conversation about the problem.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="price-grid" role="list" data-swipe aria-label="Packages">
      {%- for p in pricing.packages %}
      <li class="price-card{% if p.highlight %} price-card--featured{% endif %}" data-reveal style="--d: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        <div class="price-card__top">
          {% glyph p.glyph, "price-card__glyph" %}
          <h3 class="price-card__name"><a href="/pricing/{{ p.id }}.html" data-morph="plan-{{ p.id }}">{{ p.name }}</a></h3>
          <p class="price-card__for">{{ p.for }}</p>
        </div>
        <p class="price-card__price">
          <span class="price-card__from">from</span>
          <span class="price-card__amount">{{ p.from | inr }}</span>
        </p>
        <p class="price-card__meta mono">{{ p.weeks }} weeks · {{ p.examples }}</p>
        <ul class="ticks" role="list">
          {%- for f in p.features %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="price-card__actions">
          <a class="btn{% if not p.highlight %} btn--ghost{% endif %} price-card__cta" href="/pricing/{{ p.id }}.html">See what's in {{ p.name }}</a>
          <a class="price-card__start" href="/contact.html?plan={{ p.id }}#enquiry">or start with {{ p.name }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="price-note">{{ pricing.note }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How pricing works</p>
        <h2 class="section__title display" id="how-title">No meter running.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section__text">The same four rules on every project, whatever its size.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="price-steps" role="list">
      {%- for s in pricing.steps %}
      <li data-reveal style="--d: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        <span class="mono">Step {{ loop.index }}</span>
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="care" aria-labelledby="care-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head section__head--split" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Care plans (optional)</p>
        <h2 class="section__title display" id="care-title">After launch, we stay.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section__text">Monthly plans for real ongoing work: hosting, backups, security and improvements. Start or stop any time. Not required.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="care-grid" role="list" data-swipe aria-label="Care plans">
      {%- for c in pricing.care %}
      <li class="care-card{% if c.highlight %} care-card--featured{% endif %}" data-reveal style="--d: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        <h3 class="care-card__name"><a href="/pricing/care/{{ c.id }}.html" data-morph="care-{{ c.id }}">{{ c.name }}</a></h3>
        <p class="care-card__for">{{ c.for }}</p>
        <p class="care-card__price"><span class="price-card__amount">{{ c.monthly | inr }}</span><span class="care-card__per">/ month</span></p>
        <ul class="ticks" role="list">
          {%- for f in c.features %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost care-card__cta" href="/pricing/care/{{ c.id }}.html">What {{ c.name }} covers</a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "estimator.njk" %}

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="price-faq-title">
  <div class="wrap faq-layout">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing questions</p>
      <h2 class="section__title display" id="price-faq-title">The small&nbsp;print, big.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq" data-reveal>
      {%- for item in pricing.faq %}
      <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>{{ item.q }}<span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <p class="faq__answer">{{ item.a }}</p>
      </details>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
